+Checks
+  1. pack exists in the cited audit run, auto_place_eligible=True
+  2. run-QA verdict PASS for the same run_id
+  3. instrument guard (resolved US stock/ETF id, not crypto), long-only x1 buy
+  4. drift: |live ask - signal entry| <= 0.5 x ATR(1H)
+  5. cash after (units x ask + open fee) >= CASH_FLOOR_USD — auto-shrinks units if needed
+  6. caps after the buy: name <= 30% (ETF) / 15% (stock) of invested; sleeve <= 45% —
+     auto-shrinks units to fit; NO-GO if the shrunk position is < MIN_POSITION_USD
+  7. final cost gate with live spread + fees on the final units (expected_gain >= 2 x total_cost)
+  8. order-QA verdict PASS for the same run_id + symbol (else NO-GO ORDER_QA_PENDING, with
+     ready_for_order_qa=True when 1-7 pass so the final cost_gate can be handed to QA)
+  9. no weekend opens (IDT Sat/Sun) unless --allow-weekend (explicit Ofer override only)
